      "message": "git(mirror): silently ignore non-agit PR deletion instead of failing (#14901)\n\nOversight of #13661, discovered will working on !14885.\n\nA `git push --mirror` will try to delete all `refs/pull/.../head` references, not only the Agit ones.\nAdjust the code to silently ignore all PR deletion attempts.\n\nReviewed-on: https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/14901\nReviewed-by: Gusted <redacted@example.invalid>\n",
